# from documentation, 2026-11-22, https://developers.openai.com/api/docs/guides/error-codes
# "429 - Credit balance exhausted, Code: credit_balance_exhausted", and "The broader error.type
# can still be insufficient_quota". The message is the page's Cause; the body's shape is the
# 401's above.
HTTP 429
content-type: application/json

{"error":{"message":"Your organization has no prepaid credits remaining.","type":"insufficient_quota","code":"credit_balance_exhausted","param":null}}
